| Region | `region` | Shanghai |
| CPU Serial # | `config.cpu.serialNumber` | C470074_100-000002146-00_1T5P |
| Location | `location` | *(空)* |
| Softfuse Method | *(未在此 API 暴露)* | — |
| Platform | `platformName` / `config.motherboard.model` | MAPLE-GRGH |
| MAC Address | `executorMacAddress` | 00:00:1A:20:0E:77 |
| Executor IP | `executorIpAddress` | 10.67.186.171 |
| HDT IP | *(执行时在 testflowArguments 中传递)* | 10.67.187.9 |
| Program | `program.name` | Strix Halo |
| Owner | `username` | junczhai@amd.com |
| Status | `status` | Idle |

**GUI 上看不到但 API 能给的额外信息：**

| 信息 | API 字段路径 | 示例值 |
|------|-------------|--------|
| CPU Name | `config.cpu.name` | AMD Ryzen AI Max PRO 480 w/ Radeon 8040S |
| CPU Family/Model/Step | `config.cpu.familyHex/modelHex/steppingHex` | 0x1a / 0x70 / 0x0 |
| Cores (P/L) | `config.cpu.physicalCores/logicalCores` | 6 / 12 |
| BIOS Version | `config.bios.version` | TGH61000aA_82_WL.FD |
| BIOS Date | `config.bios.date` | 2026-07-01 |
| DIMM | `config.dimms[*]` | 4x Hynix 8GB 8533MHz |
