description: Jackson's personal work knowledge base (LLMwiki) at C:/Users/Administrator/Documents/projects/LLMwiki. Use it first, before guessing or searching the web, whenever a question or task touches AMD platform validation work - APEX test flows and queues (RemoteTestingHkysy, PowerCycleTest, PSPUnlock, ExecuteGenericCommand, ExecuteCommonWorkload, PostProcessing/HelperScripts, Dramlog), PAPI2 / hKYSY22 scripts (register batch read, relay, PDM halt/go, sys.argv clash), aHDS, AGM/AGT and Unilog, BCT/AFC BIOS config and cmd_name mapping, Niagara CBS, BIOS source (client-bios-medusa), PPR registers, Medusa2/FP10 IRM, Wingman, PiKVM/BliKVM/OPiKVM and Dediprog BIOS flashing, ATM/ATM2, MAPA, PXE/WinPE, GitHub EMU PAT, Copilot/Codex/Cursor/Claude agent setup, Firecrawl, Plotly reports - or when the user says "知识库", "wiki", "我的笔记", "之前记过", "Jackson".
